      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c6901621d95e2e592dddf49"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "We have a bit of an emergency... we are running out of coffee and other basic supplies, and the crew is starting to grumble about the situation.\n\nThe other day there was even an SOS sign posted over the empty coffee machine.",
      "branches": [
        {
