      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb02e2b0d344b1a879b0d3c"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "No, I am done with [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreErsatz],ersatz]], Yang, my family had enough hardship when they were back in the [[DM.Factions[faction_Kurita],Draconis Combine]] because of those food shortages.\n\nI need... we need proper coffee otherwise the crew might start considering mutiny.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c8fb423c17e32ac314da947"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9adad16a2c8dcb3790765a"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Look everyone, it's just a matter of finding the right supplier on this system, this is just simple coffee, we're not talking about getting any fancy like fusion engine parts.\n\nWhy can't simply buy it?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cfe35fd5bb756b35a149346"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c7e7d95c025be98fae03a21"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "That's the problem, we can't resupply because the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJumpShip],JumpShip]] servicing this [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDeepPeriphery],end of space]] has been delayed and no one knows when the next coffee shipment will arrive.\n\nAnd the nearest planet where they grow coffee is near the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreInnerSphere],Inner Sphere]], so there isn't an easy way to resupply.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c95f3069c199a22bd8bb89d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cfaaf9b885b827f5a30a1c2"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Well, someone must have some coffee around, have you tried the local black market at [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreLastpost],Lastpost]]?\n\nWe will have to pay premium but if the shortage is that big they'll surely have some stashed around, that's what black markets are for.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c982b024bdaa46261df842e"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cd99b2586a2fc49bae13573"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Commodities like coffee or chocolate can only be farmed in specific worlds so their value will skyrocket if there are delays.\n\nAnd the moment there are delays, they became even more valuable for pirates to steal and sell elsewhere.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c41f34ea26302c7bc1d12d3"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c06353d63bac29a8fc111e8"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "And the cost keeps increasing because It's a self-reinforcing spiral and no one wants to sell their inventory because the longer they hoard it, the more profit they'll assume to gain in the future.\n\nAnother prime example of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreRetronomics],retronomics]] of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreSuccessionWars],Succession Wars]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "But if the pirates have it, why can't we take it from them?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cad00270ce5ad03c55b59c8"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cc3152bf084f5f5b1396936"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "We could, there will be defenses but nothing we can't handle.\n\nAlthough the question is who exactly is responsible, since the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHyadesRim],Hyades Rim]] is plagued by several pirate groups operating from all the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreReapersScore],abandoned worlds]] out here.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c1e2b814aa64f0f5255e2c8"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca1cdca690e3eb09c6b9d09"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "That's easy, the [[DM.Factions[faction_TaurianPirates],Bloody Horns]] run most of the underground on this world, so they should have coffee or any other supplies we need.\n\nAnd buying their members a couple [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LorePPC],PPCs]] should loosen their tongues enough for us to figure out where their cache is.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cbcfd3f3c0788aa09bc2ae8"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cff678be2e76f41033a5821"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Let's start them, otherwise I might be needing some PPCs myself to calm my nerves a bit.",
      "branches": [
